{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Bird: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja36'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 36 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Kulāvakavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Nests </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>6. Sakuṇajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Bird: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Yaṁ nissitā jagatiruhaṁ vihaṅgamā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>You sky-flyers staying near the great evergreen, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Svāyaṁ aggiṁ pamuñcati; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>this fire is emerging! </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Disā bhajatha vakkaṅgā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Geese! Flee to the quarters! </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Jātaṁ saraṇato bhayan”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The threat is born from the refuge! </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Sakuṇajātakaṁ chaṭṭhaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
